{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之", "occurrences": 11, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "不肖", "id": "不肖"}, {"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "傳", "id": "傳"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "年", "id": "年"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "殺", "id": "殺"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "烹", "id": "烹"}, {"form": "父母", "id": "父母"}, {"form": "畎畝", "id": "畎畝"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "繼", "id": "繼"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "處", "id": "處"}, {"form": "要", "id": "要"}, {"form": "覺", "id": "覺"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.7954891891721947, "source": "賢", "target": "傳"}, {"weight": 3.1023420086122493, "source": "賢", "target": "繼"}, {"weight": 1.8495790401168812, "source": "賢", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.1023420086122493, "source": "賢", "target": "不肖"}, {"weight": 3.39002408106403, "source": "先", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 2.068268241081711, "source": "先", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.6968769005040847, "source": "先", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 3.6777061535158113, "source": "先", "target": "覺"}, {"weight": 3.7954891891721947, "source": "畎畝", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 2.137261112568662, "source": "畎畝", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 3.6777061535158113, "source": "畎畝", "target": "處"}, {"weight": 2.984558972955866, "source": "畎畝", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 2.137261112568662, "source": "畎畝", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.409194828052304, "source": "要", "target": "烹"}, {"we